The '''Colosseum''' is an island in the [[First Sea]] that hosts quests for players between Lv. 250 to 300. It is also where the [[Friendly PvP]] arena of First Sea is located.

==Appearance==
The  island itself is a relatively large, grassy area with sparse [[trees]] and rocks. The outer part of the island has a lighter color of grass, while the grass near the middle is darker. In the center is a large stone colosseum with multicolored banners hanging along the sides, with the [[Friendly PvP]] area in the center. Attached to the arena with a ramp is a wide stone path leading to the dock.

